{"id":"6821b9e6e2120dca","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-constructible-rank.md","title":"ZFC Constructible Rank","display":"df-zfc-constructible-rank — ZFC Constructible Rank","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-constructible-rank","aliases":["58-df-zfc-constructible-rank"],"display":"df-zfc-constructible-rank — ZFC Constructible Rank","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-constructible]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-constructible-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-constructible-rank</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-constructible-rank — ZFC Constructible Rank"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3743f726a3653802\" href=\"?note=3743f726a3653802\" title=\"58-df-constructible\">58-df-constructible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(x,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to L_\\beta\\in V)\">\\(\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to L_\\beta\\in V)\\)</span> (constructible hierarchy, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3743f726a3653802\" href=\"?note=3743f726a3653802\" title=\"58-df-constructible\">58-df-constructible</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{(-)}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(L_{(-)}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> has domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\beta\\in V:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\}\">\\(\\{\\beta\\in V:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\}\\)</span> and is the hierarchy recursion fixed by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3743f726a3653802\" href=\"?note=3743f726a3653802\" title=\"58-df-constructible\">58-df-constructible</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConstructibleRank}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConstructibleRank}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}rank} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConstructibleRank}_S(x,\\alpha) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land x\\in L_{\\alpha+1}\\land x\\notin L_\\alpha\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}rank} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConstructibleRank}_S(x,\\alpha) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land x\\in L_{\\alpha+1}\\land x\\notin L_\\alpha\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The hierarchy-stage notation is now a partial set operator with the ordinal domain stated explicitly; the rank predicate is false for nonconstructible <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> rather than assigning a spurious stage.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"3743f726a3653802","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-constructible]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"3743f726a3653802","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to L_\\beta\\in V)$ (constructible hierarchy, see [[58-df-constructible]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"3743f726a3653802","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_{(-)}:V\\rightharpoonup V$ has domain $\\{\\beta\\in V:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\}$ and is the hierarchy recursion fixed by [[58-df-constructible]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to L_\\beta\\in V)","display":false},{"tex":"L_{(-)}:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\beta\\in V:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConstructibleRank}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}rank} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConstructibleRank}_S(x,\\alpha) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land x\\in L_{\\alpha+1}\\land x\\notin L_\\alpha","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":1242,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1774","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-constructible-rank.md|58-df-zfc-constructible-rank]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3743f726a3653802","5582a281f15a33c2"]}